  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangladesh, Cambodia. The overall objective of the project is to enhance quality education in Bangladesh and Cambodia through mutual learning and cooperation, and capacity buildling of educational insitutions in the two countries. The two partners will exchange teachers in an effort to enhance the education the respective schools offer.</narrative>
  </description>
